sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Patch one cohort while the other serves
accDescr: Cohort B remains available while A is patched, B begins only after A passes the health gate.
participant R as Rollout runbook
participant A as Cohort A
participant B as Cohort B
R->>A: Install approved patches and reboot
Note over B: Serves traffic
A-->>R: Patch completion
R->>A: Application health check
alt Healthy
R->>B: Install approved patches and reboot
Note over A: Serves traffic
else Unhealthy or timed out
R->>R: Stop rollout
Note over B: Remains available
end
